1092
01:31:29,072 --> 01:31:29,592
Tamam.

1093
01:31:31,092 --> 01:31:31,932
İyi günler hocam.

1094
01:31:32,092 --> 01:31:32,332
Peki.

1095
01:31:32,492 --> 01:31:33,552
Dikkat edin kendinize arkadaşlar.

1096
01:31:33,552 --> 01:31:34,372
İyi günler hocam.

